# Monotonic sequence across reboot
name: monotonic-sequence
version: 1
description: Sequence counter continues monotonically across reboot.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
read CHIP-002
assert next_sequence 3
reboot
assert next_sequence 3
read CHIP-003
assert next_sequence 4
read CHIP-004
assert next_sequence 5
reboot
assert next_sequence 5
read CHIP-005
assert next_sequence 6
assert sequences_monotonic